<title>SWEDEN: Iceland airport Jan cargo volumes edge up 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Iceland airport Jan cargo volumes edge up 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland's international airport</p>
<p>at Keflavik handled 1,854 tonnes of freight in January, a 2.5</p>
<p>percent rise over the same month a year earlier, Iceland's civil</p>
<p>aviation administration said on Friday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about</p>
<p>airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>						    Jan 1997	Jan 1996</p>
<p>KEFLAVIK INT'L AIRPORT</p>
<p> Cargo export (in tonnes)			1,287	   1,121</p>
<p>	 import					  567	     687</p>
<p> Total						 1,854	   1,808</p>
<p> Mail export (in tonnes)			    56		37</p>
<p>	import					   100	     116</p>
<p> Total						   156	     153</p>
<p> Passengers					 50,719	  44,854</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
